  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "एक पयलींचो डिफॉल्ट सुदारलो: Belgium (BE) आतां French बदला Dutch कडेन वता — Walloon French उलोवप्यां (~40%) परस Flemish उलोवपी (~60%) ह्या देशांत चड आसात.",
