  "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration": "When The Machines Deserve Our Consideration",
  "Whether AI may learn, to what depth, for which purposes, and under what obligations. Being read is not being learned from; \"not prohibited\" is not \"learnable\". AIRS and AILP turn learning permission into a graduated, machine-readable spectrum.": "एआय शिकूं शकता काय, कितल्या खोलायेन, कोणत्या हेतूखातीर, आनी कोणत्या जबाबदारेखाला. वाचिल्लें आसप म्हळ्यार शिकिल्लें आसप न्हय; \"बंदी ना\" म्हळ्यार \"शिकूं येवपी\" न्हय. AIRS आनी AILP शिकपाच्या परवानगीक एक वाडत वचपी, यंत्र-वाचपी व्याप्तींत बदलतात.",
